
1. The names the generation dialog proposes
===========================================
project ZBP_IDNUMBERS, class prefix ZCL_
   model provider class  (MPC)      ZCL_ZBP_IDNUMBERS_MPC             
   its extension         (MPC_EXT)  ZCL_ZBP_IDNUMBERS_MPC_EXT         
   data provider class   (DPC)      ZCL_ZBP_IDNUMBERS_DPC             
   its extension         (DPC_EXT)  ZCL_ZBP_IDNUMBERS_DPC_EXT         
   technical model name             ZBP_IDNUMBERS_MDL                 
   technical service name           ZBP_IDNUMBERS_SRV                 

project API_BUSINESS_PARTNER, class prefix CL_
   model provider class  (MPC)      CL_API_BUSINESS_PARTNER_MPC       
   its extension         (MPC_EXT)  CL_API_BUSINESS_PARTNER_MPC_EXT      <- 31 characters: too long, choose a name by hand
   data provider class   (DPC)      CL_API_BUSINESS_PARTNER_DPC       
   its extension         (DPC_EXT)  CL_API_BUSINESS_PARTNER_DPC_EXT      <- 31 characters: too long, choose a name by hand
   technical model name             API_BUSINESS_PARTNER_MDL          
   technical service name           API_BUSINESS_PARTNER_SRV          

project GWSAMPLE_BASIC, class prefix /IWBEP/CL_
   model provider class  (MPC)      /IWBEP/CL_GWSAMPLE_BASIC_MPC      
   its extension         (MPC_EXT)  /IWBEP/CL_GWSAMPLE_BASIC_MPC_EXT     <- 32 characters: too long, choose a name by hand
   data provider class   (DPC)      /IWBEP/CL_GWSAMPLE_BASIC_DPC      
   its extension         (DPC_EXT)  /IWBEP/CL_GWSAMPLE_BASIC_DPC_EXT     <- 32 characters: too long, choose a name by hand
   technical model name             GWSAMPLE_BASIC_MDL                
   technical service name           GWSAMPLE_BASIC_SRV                

service document, once the service is registered in the hub: /sap/opu/odata/sap/ZBP_IDNUMBERS_SRV/
$metadata:                                                   /sap/opu/odata/sap/ZBP_IDNUMBERS_SRV/$metadata

2. From the Dictionary field to the EDM property
================================================
entity type BusinessPartner (entity set BusinessPartnerSet), keys: BusinessPartner
   BUT000-PARTNER           CHAR 10    -> Edm.String    Nullable=false MaxLength=10
   BusinessPartnerName      CHAR 80    -> Edm.String    MaxLength=80
   BUT000-CRDAT             DATS       -> Edm.DateTime  Precision=0 sap:display-format=Date
   BUT000-CRTIM             TIMS       -> Edm.Time      Precision=0
   BUT000-XBLCK             CHAR 1     -> Edm.Boolean     (chosen in the model, not the default)
entity type BPIdentification (entity set BPIdentificationSet), keys: BusinessPartner, BPIdentificationType, BPIdentificationNumber
   BUT0ID-PARTNER           CHAR 10    -> Edm.String    Nullable=false MaxLength=10
   BUT0ID-TYPE              CHAR 6     -> Edm.String    Nullable=false MaxLength=6
   BUT0ID-IDNUMBER          CHAR 60    -> Edm.String    Nullable=false MaxLength=60
   BUT0ID-VALID_DATE_FROM   DATS       -> Edm.DateTime  Precision=0 sap:display-format=Date
   BUT0ID-VALID_DATE_TO     DATS       -> Edm.DateTime  Precision=0 sap:display-format=Date
   BUT0ID-COUNTRY           CHAR 3     -> Edm.String    MaxLength=3

the same rule for the amount and quantity types, which this model does not have:
   VBAP-POSNR               NUMC 6     -> Edm.String    MaxLength=6
   VBAP-NETWR               CURR 15,2  -> Edm.Decimal   Precision=15 Scale=2 sap:unit=Currency
   VBAP-WAERK               CUKY 5     -> Edm.String    MaxLength=5
   VBAP-KWMENG              QUAN 15,3  -> Edm.Decimal   Precision=15 Scale=3 sap:unit=Unit
   VBAP-VRKME               UNIT 3     -> Edm.String    MaxLength=3
   BUT000-PARTNER_GUID      RAW 16     -> Edm.Binary    

